# 🏪 Store Rating Platform

A full-stack web application that allows users to discover registered stores and submit ratings from 1 to 5. The platform provides role-based access for System Administrators, Normal Users, and Store Owners.

Built using **React.js, Node.js, Express.js, and PostgreSQL**.

## 🚀 Features

### 1. System Administrator
- Admin login with role-based authentication.
- Dashboard displaying total users, stores, and submitted ratings.
- Add new stores and assign store owners.
- Create Normal Users, Store Owners, and Admin accounts.
- View and manage registered users.
- View all registered stores and their overall ratings.
- Search, filter, and sort users and stores.
- View user details, including role and address.

### 2. Normal User
- User registration and login.
- View all registered stores.
- Search stores by name and address.
- View overall store ratings.
- Submit ratings between 1 and 5.
- Update previously submitted ratings.
- Update account password.

### 3. Store Owner
- Secure login.
- Dedicated owner dashboard.
- View users who submitted ratings for their store.
- View the average rating of their store.
- Update account password.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| React.js | Frontend |
| Tailwind CSS | UI Styling |
| Node.js | Backend Runtime |
| Express.js | REST API |
| PostgreSQL | Database |
| JWT | Authentication |
| bcrypt | Password Hashing |
| Axios | API Requests |
| React Router | Frontend Routing |

